{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-26T08:58:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114642690461814985"], "id": "2114642690461814985", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1261, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "客户：“预算有限，能不能简单做一下？”\n\n我：“可以，哪些功能先不做？”\n\n客户：“功能都要，简单做一下就行。”", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114642690461814985"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T08:49:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114640528059035693"], "id": "2114640528059035693", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759530111534243840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 257, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114634888926118371", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "这么好的作品，应该让更多人知道", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114640528059035693"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T08:27:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114634888926118371"], "id": "2114634888926118371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 2247, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114337645148979380", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "阿磊开源了一个做做雅思背单词了网站\n\n划重点： 免费 ！ 开源！ https://t.co/RKkk4a6wVh", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114634888926118371"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114622044361170944"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:49:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114625326081028264"], "id": "2114625326081028264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 807, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "果真还得是线下，深度交流起来，才能碰撞出机会啊啊啊 https://t.co/oRI8CFzONw", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114625326081028264"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114584025755168768"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114613749889851556"], "id": "2114613749889851556", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1864, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2103300004966478284", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽 ❗️❗️❗️  还是得承认,   Grok Bot 做视频还是比 Opus 5.5 做视频,  有很大的差距.  \n\n估计是 Grok Bot 智能路由, 没有路由到 Opus 5.5 . https://t.co/S3wOeQ8MD7 https://t.co/4dwpt0X68P", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114613749889851556"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T06:22:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114603431709364595"], "id": "2114603431709364595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1977, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114288790198276495", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,   Muse 更对年轻人的胃口,    Grok Bot 更对中年的胃口\n\nSimilarweb 发了 Grok Bot 和 Meta Muse 的 9 月全球用户画像对比，这两个工具吃的是两拨人。\n\n18到34岁这一段，Muse 合起来占了 70.4%，比 Grok Bot 高出10个百分点，女用户占比也到了 30.07%。Meta https://t.co/0sNKXa4Kzd", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114603431709364595"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114533444663246848"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T05:38:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114592358650016059"], "id": "2114592358650016059", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 879, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Devin 这么强的啊 ! ! !  \n\n这个视频是用 Devin Cloud Agents 连上真实 macOS 云机器，在 Device Hub 里多人一起改一款折叠屏 iPhone Duo 应用。\n\n https://t.co/MmGugxcNdg", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114592358650016059"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114551341867806720"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:48:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114579998501974191"], "id": "2114579998501974191", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1152, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Alex 拿真机把四家主流 AI 应用在折叠屏 iPhone Duo 上挨个跑了一遍，直接给分：Meta Muse 10 分、Claude 9.5 分、ChatGPT 9 分、Grok Bot 8 分。\n\nGrok Bot 是四家里唯一还没专门适配 Duo 的，右边会留一条黑边，但左列常驻 Agent 清单、右边大屏看消息，底子反而很搭双屏；\n\nChatGPT", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114579998501974191"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114569759308304384"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:08:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114569846298198351"], "id": "2114569846298198351", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 746, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有个 X 友要加入我的付费群,   结果拉群的时候, 微信不让拉 \n\n说是 \"存在安全风险\"\n\n不懂就问,  这是什么原因 \n\n他说他最近他最近待的有个群被封了 https://t.co/h7L5SQ2kT4", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114569846298198351"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114555741621334016"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:13:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114555118935027985", "2114555871644745734"], "id": "2114555871644745734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 785, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114504726691856632", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,  价值 1599$ 的技术峰会,  现在不用花钱就能了解硅谷AI峰会的顶级洞察了 https://t.co/IU48aUSCiD https://t.co/XFmVoeEs3m", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114555871644745734"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114538578344923136"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:06:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114539221973365233"], "id": "2114539221973365233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5845, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2103300004966478284", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🚨🚨🚨 Muse 的大版本升级又冷不丁的来了  \n\n这回是 8.0 -&gt; 9.0 \n\n搜了半圈,  没发现 9.0 升级了个啥 \n\n顶级科技产品升级也这么不透明的嘛 https://t.co/p8EYZ7xv1D https://t.co/4dwpt0XDYn", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114539221973365233"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T01:48:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114534551938842781"], "id": "2114534551938842781", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 525, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114271904886567061", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "可可老师搞活动了, 支持一下 https://t.co/Ae0zQff56X", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114534551938842781"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T00:54:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114520929351148032"], "id": "2114520929351148032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 624, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114407583167705279", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "好期待这样一款代理语言 \n\nRust 快是快,  就是编译太慢了\nGo 是设计空间小,  比 Rust 慢 \n\nBend 期待一下 https://t.co/dad5pX68Ed", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114520929351148032"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114393312132313088"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:28:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114393685597278329"], "id": "2114393685597278329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 611, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113898167133712465", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,  这个提示词好玩.  \n\n我的房间出来了, 我只能说只有60% 的相似度 \n\n不过这个房间人机协作倒是挺合适的 https://t.co/Funy54PB7w https://t.co/WYyzcKRwJA", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114393685597278329"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T15:39:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114381226530472425"], "id": "2114381226530472425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 38, "impression_count": 3175, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114353320852865530", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "上周有人发帖说 Grok Bot 云电脑回滚到 6～7 周前的旧快照（41 万浏览），几周工作全乱了。这篇花 20 分钟用开源的 Syncthing 配了一套单向实时备份，Bot 改完文件十几秒后 Mac 上就有，连误删都能从历史版本里捞回来。\n\n做法就三步：Mac 装好 Syncthing 拿到 Device ID；给 Grok Bot 发一条 https://t.co/AY3nixLPaK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114381226530472425"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T14:59:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114371309723582569"], "id": "2114371309723582569", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1905, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114362244700266849", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok bot （0.77.0-pre.20 到 pre.26）里的 14 项改动。\n\n最实的几块：\n结账能直接选存好的卡或 X Money 付给商家；\nGrok Bot 拨电话前先弹审批卡，写明事由、代谁打和合规同意；\n订餐厅状态覆盖等位、留台和按人数确认，还能带 Yelp 评分；\n另外预埋了跑在客户私有 worker（带密钥同步）、共享 Bot https://t.co/UKYVLgn1A8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114371309723582569"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114342866453741568"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:51:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114354089610145909"], "id": "2114354089610145909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 4298, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "卡兹克花 5 天、用掉 30% 的 Claude 周额度和两管 Codex 额度，把散在桌面定时、Webhook 后台 CLI、Dots 里的 Agent 自动化任务，做成了《戴森球计划》那种微缩景观流水线，平时挂个小屏幕就能当桌搭。\n\n片子里 14", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114354089610145909"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114332567889649664"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:28:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114333365688320501"], "id": "2114333365688320501", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 8294, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109544824135467312", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽  ❗️❗️❗️ Rea 即将超越 Openclaw 了 , 只差 12 K Star 的差距了 \n\n超越 Openclaw 基本上是板上钉钉了 \n\n而且 Fork 数也快超过 100 K  了 ,   只能是超级爆款开源项目 \n\n现象级中的现象级啊啊啊啊 \n\nhttps://t.co/rcn3WKkLkt https://t.co/rfZAeM1x7M", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114333365688320501"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114321547779584000"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T11:45:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114322487211389379"], "id": "2114322487211389379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 670, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "记得上次见到 V 神 ,  还是在 24年的泰国 ,  那时候的 Eth Devcon 真是盛况空前 https://t.co/S7zYI2c4W3", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114322487211389379"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T11:12:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114314064562442366", "2114314271215763748"], "id": "2114314271215763748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1658, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113478290661163067", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这份小红书指南, 放到咸鱼去至少也得卖 199 吧\n\nhttps://t.co/rRXOfguTnE https://t.co/06KGMjaHxr", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114314271215763748"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T10:24:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114301945204682949"], "id": "2114301945204682949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 1047, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114289208793973231", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Kin 半个月创作者收益破 1000 美元，对应后台大约 81 万认证曝光。这篇把申请门槛、港卡、提现拆成 20 问讲清楚。\n\n门槛硬核就几条：开 Premium，至少 500 认证粉，近 90 天约 50 万自然曝光。曝光只算蓝 V 在首页时间线刷到你，回复和大 V 评论区刷出来的都不算门槛。 https://t.co/wPGPdIgP7C", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114301945204682949"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T09:54:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114294402189570539"], "id": "2114294402189570539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1050, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114120833807343618", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "做了四年半代码审查工具的 Jacob Gold（原 Graphite，现 Cursor / SpaceXAI 做 Origin），现在劝人别再一行行审 PR。\n\n他盯的一直是同一段：PR 提出来到合进主干。2025 年他算过，动手到提 PR 的时间砍一半，团队大概快 10%；提 PR https://t.co/dG4xyF7HHr", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114294402189570539"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114258069517729792"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T08:52:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114279020896350322"], "id": "2114279020896350322", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 349, "impression_count": 24089, "like_count": 349, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 43}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113195080517562646", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "牛逼 ！！！ 今天去用了 Lemomo 开源的 Lemo-Opuscar 去做视频，顿时被震惊了。 3D 效果太好了。 仓库 GitHub 约 6.8k 星，这次从「挑风格做片」改成「自己搭风格库」。\n\n风格从 39 涨到 59，新加 8 种剪辑与纪实：字幕新闻、1920s https://t.co/pR74YYsBcq", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114279020896350322"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114622044361170944", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114584025755168768", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2114533444663246848", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2114551341867806720", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114569759308304384", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114555741621334016", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114538578344923136", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114393312132313088", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114342866453741568", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2114332567889649664", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114321547779584000", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114258069517729792", "type": "video"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2114642690461814985", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g75yxeup4q3vx073a0xq2pwr3m", "oldest_id": "2114279020896350322", "previous_token": "77qpymm88g5h9vqkmfprnlih6yza3msggjek6lkmi4n5h", "result_count": 23}}